{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09491","headline":"夏冰歌 · 韦应物","name":"夏冰歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出自玄泉杳杳之深井，汲在朱明赫赫之炎辰。\n九天含露未销铄，阊阖初开赐贵人。\n碎如坠琼方截璐，粉壁生寒象筵布。\n玉壶纨扇亦玲珑，座有丽人色俱素。\n咫尺炎凉变四时，出门焦灼君讵知。\n肥羊甘醴心闷闷，饮此莹然何所思。\n当念阑干凿者苦，腊月深井汗如雨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09491.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09491","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}